{"id": "DdmBrCdzABG", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "“Maa… mujhe Shiv ko paana hai.” 🥺\nEk rajkumari ka sapna…\nEk tapaswini ka sankalp…\nAur ek Mahadev ka intezaar। 💫\nJab rishi-muniyon ne Mahadev ki katha sunayi, tab Devi Parvati ko nahi pata tha ki woh khud Adi Shakti hain — wahi Sati, wahi Shakti, jo kabhi jag ki Maa thi। 🔥\nBarson beet gaye… ⛈️\nRituen badal gayi… ❄️\nDhoop ne jalaya, him ne dhaka… ☀️\nPar woh tiki rahin।\nAur unke ghor tap ne ek insaan ko Bhagwan bana diya —\njab tak khud Shiv ne unhe swikaar na kar liya। 🏔️❤️#mahadev #parvati #sanatandharma #lordshiva #rishikathabooks", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1790089926, "like_count": 74, "comment_count": 7, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2465929790564041a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 73.628, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMXaSND2xR8lMr9hwaH8S8QnQddEqe-S8CnvesSeZXYWzrN69Ddxotz4ugsMp1oEV6V-xCVNAVd-b0wu-yQtbdyeF36p_tTuOFoyB8.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_oc=AdqOEZBJ1RKkebpGaQPL5erYTRmj2LuA-2Du69MH-FjZBLOMAm0U3tLn5W4eOdEkM7Zsgs1sqs29rN9Spa0C1Hjv&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=oSgyUGgim8UQ7kNvwG3iZoL&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=kMEu-irIpIh7qD16jAkm-Q&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQza-IA_lzEQRtLZhcHRQJ95V656I0UZwhNAzBK2UYIrA&oe=6AF41B00", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 73.628, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "naviga